<title>GERMANY: BHF Bank 9-mo oper profit up 6.6 pct.</title>
<headline>BHF Bank 9-mo oper profit up 6.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30, 1996 (in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit after provisions    258    up  6.6 pct</p>
<p>    Group net bad debt provisions	   137    up 11.4 pct</p>
<p>    Group own-account trading profit	 67    +/- 0 pct</p>
<p>    Group net interest income		 568    up  4.6 pct</p>
<p>    Group net commission income	     333    up  4.7 pct</p>
<p>    Group operating costs		     595    up  4.8 pct</p>
<p>    Group lending volume			58,600 up  8.1 pct</p>
<p>    Group balance sheet total		 72,900 up 12.2 pct</p>
<p>    Group business volume		     81,100 up 10.3 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is BHF-Bank AG. Results compare with first nine months of 1994. Lending, balance sheet total and business volume compare with end-1994.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
